; Unit tests of the grades: the grade lattices, the products of grades, the
; literals of every grade, the four implementations of the regular trace
; languages, by automata and by three kinds of derivatives, the regex grades
; with banked delays with their closures, the sets of delays, the timed regular
; expressions with the regular trace languages over rational delays, and the
; regex grades with banked delays over rational delays with their closures; the
; sets of delays against an implementation by lists of intervals; the laws of
; every registered grade and of the morphism of every registered grade system,
; on samples, by the checks the tests share; the
; inter-arrival grade against concrete computations; the grades with
; banked delays against their translations into the timed regex grades; and
; the run consistency of the intervals of the timed regex grades against the
; reference.

